window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Three keys to claiming Wonderland's throne:</p> <ol> <li>Win over the citizens (who are caught up in a drug-fueled daze).</li> <li>Recover the magical artifacts of my royal line (which are hidden behind a squad of brutal guards).</li> <li>Draw on the love of the three most extraordinary men I've ever met (one of whom is held captive by a tyrant queen).</li> </ol> <p>Okay, I've got my work cut out for me. But my people and my lovers are counting on me. I won't give up this wondrous land that feels more like a home than the world I grew up in ever did.</p> <p>There's a new queen in town. The Hearts and Diamonds had better get ready to bow down.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
